{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is SokoChess?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SokoChess is a minimalistic puzzle game that combines Chess with the Sokoban block-pushing formula. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal of each level is to push black pieces to predetermined positions while making sure they don't capture all your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Push the black pieces</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.poster.avif?t=1757579536\" width=600 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.webm?t=1757579536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f5cd5f3611bab58da77de4ce153c56d6.mp4?t=1757579536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The goal of each level is to push all the black pieces to their destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Careful where you move</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.poster.avif?t=1757579536\" width=600 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.webm?t=1757579536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/58b95d2fb5f6958b9c3a50f4b4ebf585.mp4?t=1757579536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The black pieces will only move if you give them an opportunity to capture one of your pieces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960400/extras/f07a4af4500ac67319d6dfaa42a53ebc.avif?t=1757579536\" width=620 height=85 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 70 levels </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Infinite undos </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Don't like a level you are playing? Skip it </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Puzzle elements you won't see in Chess </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Unique gameplay combining Chess and Sokoban </p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Pawn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/464a3169377b5a652517cc5fbbd206e41ca89135.jpg"},{"name":"Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/b39ec7b4a484401ef9b193241f5678977396c3ab.jpg"},{"name":"Bishop","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/f7dc675a0d0295109403581b5136c8a53f2bc059.jpg"},{"name":"Rook","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/4b8bdc915db0a89246cc5627065564248575e634.jpg"},{"name":"Queen","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/5864e52ccb9eef81ea6945078926ad1b8bcd9aa5.jpg"},{"name":"King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/1c818a9aef795f3c56062238e8b2b918f6ec57bf.jpg"},{"name":"Grandmaster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/78e5225a983d391c3a05fb31a27250b0718c3cbc.jpg"},{"name":"Completionist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/5f6f09d6246d3ccdc08ac59eb9fb92b583cee77a.jpg"},{"name":"Thanks for the support!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1960400/ce34f1